        <h2>Black Holes</h2>

        <p>
            A black hole is a place in space where gravity is very strong.
            Nothing can escape from a black hole, not even light. Black holes
            are very interesting and scientists study them to learn more
            about space.
        </p>


        <p>
            Black holes can be formed when very large stars die. There are
            also very large black holes in the center of galaxies. Scientists
            study black holes by looking at their effect on nearby stars
            and other objects.
        </p>


